job_description:
Position: Backend Engineer (Example Corp)
Responsibilities:
1. Design, build and maintain backend services and APIs;
2. Take part in technical reviews for order and payment flows;
3. Work with frontend and QA to ship features and fix production issues;
4. Improve service performance and reliability.
Requirements:
1. BS or above in Computer Science or a related field;
2. Familiar with Python or Go, MySQL and Redis;
3. Good communication and coding habits;
4. Internship or project experience preferred.
